data: {"id": "b26e59d329cc4834-thinking-parallel_evidence-735", "run_id": "b26e59d329cc4834", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "开始调查 Pod `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b`。首先执行首轮诊断，获取 Pod 的描述、事件、日志和追踪信息。\n\n**首轮计划：**\n1. `kubectl describe pod` - 确认 Pod 当前状态、容器状态、重启次数。\n2. `kubectl events` - 查看 Pod 相关事件，特别是 CrashLoopBackOff 的细节。\n3. `kubectl logs` (当前和 previous) - 查看容器崩溃前后的日志。\n4. `kubectl get yaml` - 获取 Pod 完整 YAML，检查配置。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788789310456, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

